msgctxt "232"
msgid "Oh, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna stay here and try to make the puppy like me.\r\n"
"Can you go get that ball?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna stay here and try to make the puppy like me.\r\n"
"Can you go get that cat toy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna stay here and try to make the puppy like me.\r\n"
"Can you go get that stuffed animal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna stay here and try to make the puppy like me.\r\n"
"Can you go get that bone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Got it, Izumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Yay! Thanks, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "You handed over the <Color:8>Rubber Ball<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Look, doggy! A nice ball!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Why doesn't he wanna play...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Hm, I could've sworn that would work. Aren't dogs supposed\r\n"
"to like fetching balls?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "He's probably still spooked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Got it, Izumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Yay! Thanks, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "You handed over the <Color:8>Green Cat Toy<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Look, doggy! A cat toy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "He's not doing anything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"Hm, I probably should've guessed that would happen. He's not\r\n"
"a cat, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "I dunno, I think he's still spooked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Got it, Izumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Yay! Thanks, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "You handed over the <Color:8>Stuffed Animal<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Wait, not this one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Huh? Why not?"
msgstr "Eh? Perché no?"

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"It's my favorite! If you were gonna take one from home, you\r\n"
"should've taken the one next to it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "...But they looked exactly the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "No! Look at the tail! It's special!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "I'm not sure I understand."
msgstr "Non sono sicuro di capire."

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Just, not this one! Gosh, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "(...Guess I should've taken the cat. Or maybe the bird.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Nice try there, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Izumi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Oh, Uncle Kaz! Did you get that bone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"About that. I looked all over, but I couldn't actually get\r\n"
"my hands on one. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr "Mpf."

msgctxt "700"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Should I, uh... go get something else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "I don't care!"
msgstr "Non mi importa!"

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"(She doesn't seem very happy...)\r\n"
"(...It seems I've upset her.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Hmmm, what else would a dog want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "C'mon, Izumi-chan. Let's throw in the towel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "How long are you gonna keep at this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "As long as it takes! I'm not leaving until he comes home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "...Guess we'll have to figure something out, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"Why don't you take a stroll, sir? Clear your head, y'know?\r\n"
"I won't let Izumi-chan outta my sight while you're gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "Yeah, that's not a bad idea. I'll be back in a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Oh, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna stay here and try to make the puppy like me.\r\n"
"Can you go get some dog food?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna stay here and try to make the puppy like me.\r\n"
"Can you go get a hamburger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna stay here and try to make the puppy like me.\r\n"
"Can you go get some milk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna stay here and try to make the puppy like me.\r\n"
"Can you go get that bone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "Here you go, Izumi. Dog food."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "Yay! Thanks, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "You handed over the <Color:8>Dog Food<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai consegnato la <Color:8>Zappa<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "I hope he eats it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "...He's not eating it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"Huh, I really thought he'd like that. Guess he's still\r\n"
"afraid of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Or maybe he's just not hungry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "I'm back, Izumi. Me and this piping hot hamburger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "Yay! Thanks, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "You handed over the <Color:8>Hamburger<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai consegnato la <Color:8>Zappa<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "I hope he eats it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "...He's not eating it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid ""
"Shoot. I seriously thought that would work. Guess he's more\r\n"
"afraid of us than I realized."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "Yeah, or maybe he's just not hungry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "Here you go, Izumi. Fresh milk for a fresh dog."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "I dunno what you're talking about, but thanks, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "You handed over the <Color:8>Milk<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai consegnato il <Color:8>Sake<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1252"
msgid "I hope he drinks it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "...He's not drinking it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid ""
"Hm, I thought dogs were supposed to like milk. Or is that\r\n"
"cats? Anyway, I guess he's still afraid of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "Or maybe he's just not thirsty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid "Izumi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "Oh, Uncle Kaz! Did you get that bone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid ""
"About that. I looked all over, but I couldn't actually get\r\n"
"my hands on one. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr "Mpf."

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "Should I, uh... go get something else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "I don't care!"
msgstr "Non mi importa!"

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "(She doesn't seem very happy...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, do you know what kinda toys dogs like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "Toys, huh? Hm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "A ball would be good. Something to play fetch with, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "That's kinda boring... but okay. Can you go get one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "...Me again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid ""
"I can't go now, I think he's starting to get used to me!\r\n"
"Please, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid "You might not believe it, but they actually like cat toys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid ""
"That doesn't make sense! But I trust you, Uncle Kaz.\r\n"
"Can you go get one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "...Me again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid ""
"I can't go now, I think he's starting to get used to me!\r\n"
"Please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "He's just a pup, so maybe he'd like a stuffed animal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid "Oh yeah, that's a good idea! Can you go get one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid "...Me again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1576"
msgid ""
"I can't go now, I think he's starting to get used to me!\r\n"
"Please, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1600"
msgid "Definitely bones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1612"
msgid "Bones? Really, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1624"
msgid ""
"Sure. You always see dogs in cartoons chewing on them, so\r\n"
"a real dog would probably think the same way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1636"
msgid "Okay! Can you go get one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1648"
msgid "...Me again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1660"
msgid "Please!"
msgstr "Ti prego!"

msgctxt "1672"
msgid "I don't know where I'm gonna find a bone, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1684"
msgid "But it was your idea! Come on, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1720"
msgid ""
"...All right, I'll be back in a minute. Keep an eye on Izumi\r\n"
"for me, Mikio."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1732"
msgid "Will do."
msgstr "Ci penso io."

msgctxt "1744"
msgid ""
"(...Wait, what did I say that for? I already know that's\r\n"
"not happening.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1756"
msgid "Actually, Izumi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1768"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "1780"
msgid "I already went out looking for a bone earlier, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1792"
msgid "So?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1804"
msgid "So there wouldn't be much point in going out again... right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1816"
msgid "Well duh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1828"
msgid "You're the worst, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1840"
msgid "Come on now, Izumi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1852"
msgid "Nice one, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1864"
msgid ""
"(I didn't think one dumb suggestion would upset her that\r\n"
"much... Kids are really something else.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1924"
msgid "Hmmm, what else would a dog want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1936"
msgid "C'mon, Izumi-chan. Let's throw in the towel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1948"
msgid "How long are you gonna keep at this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1960"
msgid "As long as it takes! I'm not leaving until he comes home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1972"
msgid "...Guess we'll have to figure something out, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1984"
msgid ""
"Why don't you take a stroll, sir? Clear your head, y'know?\r\n"
"I won't let Izumi-chan outta my sight while you're gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1996"
msgid "Yeah, that's not a bad idea. I'll be back in a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2020"
msgid ""
"...All right, I'll be back in a minute. Keep an eye on Izumi\r\n"
"for me, Mikio."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2032"
msgid "Will do."
msgstr "Ci penso io."

msgctxt "2068"
msgid ""
"(Now to find a ball. I think I've seen Koji practicing\r\n"
"baseball with one...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2080"
msgid ""
"(Now to find a cat toy. But there aren't any pet shops\r\n"
"around here...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2092"
msgid ""
"(Wait, maybe I could use a foxtail instead! I'm pretty sure\r\n"
"I've seen some down on the beach near Morning Glory...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2104"
msgid ""
"(Now to find a stuffed animal. Pretty sure the kids' room\r\n"
"back at the orphanage is full of them...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2116"
msgid ""
"(I should've just kept my big mouth shut. Where am I\r\n"
"supposed to find a bone around here anyway? Guess I\r\n"
"could always check the stores...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2128"
msgid "A ball would be good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2140"
msgid "Cat toys, believe it or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2152"
msgid "Maybe a stuffed animal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2164"
msgid "Definitely bones!"
msgstr ""

